<item><title>Niger&apos;s National Guard seizes rocket launchers meant for Boko Haram</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ne/niger-s-national-guard-seizes-rocket-launchers-meant-for-755392/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ne/niger-s-national-guard-seizes-rocket-launchers-meant-for-755392/</guid><category>Niger</category><description>Troops found 12 RPG-7 launchers and 11 rockets hidden in a bush near Bonigrat, in the Diffa region near Lake Chad.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 10:45:32 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ne.jpg" length="31036" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ne.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
